{
  "name": "cep_mesh_e2e",
  "description": "CEP coherence 流量**穿过真实 RouterTLM XY mesh**(2×2)抵达对端 —— change `cpptlm-cep-mesh-e2e-carrier` 的联合拓扑。路径:业务流量(TrafficGen)→ 端口面 wrapper(`StubCacheEndpointTLM`)→ **CohIf 网络接口**(`CohIfNICTLM` × 2)→ RouterTLM 2×2 mesh(16 条 connection,4 个 router 全参与)→ 对端 `CohIfNICTLM` → home 简化模型(`CohIfResponderTLM`)→ Completion 原路返回。⚠️ **连接条数是实测定稿的**(探针 `test/test_zz_mesh_probe.cc`,5 用例):router↔router 与 router↔NIC **各需 2 条**(缺一 ⇒ flit 停在源 router);2×2 的 4 条环边(r00-r01-r11-r10-r00)构成 X-first 的去程(r00→r01→r11)与回程(r11→r10→r00)两条路径。⚠️ `nic_a`/`nic_b` **各自**都配 `address_regions`(0x1000-0x2000 映射到对方节点)⇒ 回程的 `lookup_node` 也能命中。",
  "modules": [
    {
      "name": "tg",
      "type": "TrafficGenTLM",
      "params": {
        "seed": 20261116
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "w",
      "type": "StubCacheEndpointTLM"
    },
    {
      "name": "home",
      "type": "CohIfResponderTLM",
      "params": {
        "emit_completions": true
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "nic_a",
      "type": "CohIfNICTLM",
      "params": {
        "node_id": 0,
        "mesh_x": 2,
        "mesh_y": 2,
        "address_regions": [
          {
            "base": "0x1000",
            "size": "0x1000",
            "target_node": 3
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "nic_b",
      "type": "CohIfNICTLM",
      "params": {
        "node_id": 3,
        "mesh_x": 2,
        "mesh_y": 2,
        "address_regions": [
          {
            "base": "0x1000",
            "size": "0x1000",
            "target_node": 0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "r00",
      "type": "RouterTLM",
      "params": {
        "node_x": 0,
        "node_y": 0,
        "mesh_x": 2,
        "mesh_y": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "r01",
      "type": "RouterTLM",
      "params": {
        "node_x": 1,
        "node_y": 0,
        "mesh_x": 2,
        "mesh_y": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "r10",
      "type": "RouterTLM",
      "params": {
        "node_x": 0,
        "node_y": 1,
        "mesh_x": 2,
        "mesh_y": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "r11",
      "type": "RouterTLM",
      "params": {
        "node_x": 1,
        "node_y": 1,
        "mesh_x": 2,
        "mesh_y": 2
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": [
